&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Innovation &amp;amp; Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunity to work with AI-driven technologies, contribute to building AI-powered solutions, and leverage AI tools to enhance automation, engineering efficiency, and DevOps practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in DevOps or Platform Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience owning and improving production cloud infrastructure at a senior level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field (or equivalent work experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep, hands-on Microsoft Azure expertise is essential&lt;/strong&gt;, with substantial production experience across Azure compute, networking, storage, and identity (Entra ID).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong hands-on CI/CD engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing, building, troubleshooting, and improving production pipelines, repositories, and deployment workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong hands-on Infrastructure as Code (IaC) experience&lt;/strong&gt; managing production cloud infrastructure. Terraform is preferred; strong experience with comparable IaC technologies will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently investigate unfamiliar or complex environments, identify technical gaps, and drive solutions with limited direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in scripting and automation languages (e.g., PowerShell, Python, Bash).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerization and orchestration technologies (e.g., Docker, Kubernetes, AKS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of observability (e.g., MELT) and related tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Azure security tooling, including Microsoft Defender for Cloud, Key Vault, and RBAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of networking fundamentals in Azure (VNets, NSGs, Private Endpoints, DNS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills across development, operations, and stakeholder teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;GitLab/GitLab CI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Azure certifications (e.g., AZ-104)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;repository and CI/CD pipeline migrations&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly to GitLab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to security and code quality scanning tools such as SonarQube, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in regulated industries or with compliance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTE: As this is an Ireland-based remote role, we’re looking for candidates who are currently based in Ireland.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual base salary gross: : 70,000-85,000 EUR plus variable&lt;/strong&gt;. The base salary range represents the low and high end of the Company&#39;s contemplated salary range for this position. Actual salaries will vary and will be based on various factors, such as the candidate’s qualifications, skills, competencies, and geographic location. The salary is one component of Company&#39;s total compensation package for employees. Other rewards and benefits include variable compensation, short-term incentives, health insurance (several options to choose from), accident and life insurance, access to the best in class learning and development platforms, flexible work arrangement, to name just a few!&lt;/p&gt;
